  m_text: "A lone cat warrior who has awoken in a world overrun by slimes and dark
    creatures. \n\r\nArmed with a sword, the warrior must battle through increasingly
    dangerous lands to find and defeat the source of the corruption. Along the way,
    the warrior discovers checkpoints that restore their strength. \n\r\nThe key
    mechanic \u2014 the Soul Clash \u2014 allows the warrior to meet enemy attacks
    head-on, earning Soul Energy that powers special abilities.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dc36b3fdc14f47ebb36fd484a67e268a, type: 2}
